docs/runbooks/slo.md:40:| SLO | Draft target | Window | Why not 100 percent |
docs/runbooks/slo.md:42:| local scrape availability | >= 99.0% | 30m | local Docker / kind / port-forward may restart |
docs/runbooks/slo.md:43:| local HTTP error ratio | < 5.0% | 10m | Week10 has no production traffic model |
docs/runbooks/slo.md:44:| local p95 latency | < 1s | 10m | development cluster and laptop/server contention may affect latency |
docs/runbooks/slo.md:45:| local rollout recoverability | rollout status succeeds and rollback dry-run command remains available | per rollout test | manual release evidence, not a continuous SLO |
